  {
    "id": 2019005110050,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "おぉ〜、マジで載ってるし！　ハンパないわ～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自分で買って見ると、やっぱり感動するよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110060,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "お！　プロデューサーわかってんじゃん！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺が愛依の立場でも、きっとそう思うだろうからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、そういえば２冊買ってたな\r\nなくしたり破れたりした時のための予備か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "mei"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も大事な雑誌はそうしたりするんだけど\r\n愛依もそうなのかと思ってな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110070,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "あ〜、違う違う\r\n１冊は家族用！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110080,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "みんなうちのこと\r\nちょー応援してくれるからさぁ、このくらいはってカンジ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いい家族だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110090,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "アハハ、サンキュ",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110100,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "けどさ、下の弟とかちょいヤンチャだから\r\nたまに破っちゃったりすんの！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110110,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "あ！　じゃあもっと買っといた方がよかったかも！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それなら、買いに戻るか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110120,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "うーん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110121,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "やっぱだいじょぶ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110121"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110130,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "弟には破ったらおしおきするぞ〜って言うから！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110140,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "でもさぁ、プロデューサー\r\nこういうのってなーんか不思議なカンジじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こういうの？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110150,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "そ、雑誌に自分が載ったりとかさ\r\nフツーにしてたら絶対ありえないじゃん",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110160,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "昔のうちに言っても信じないだろうな～",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁ、確かに自分が誌面に載るって\r\n普通に暮らしてたらないもんな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "有名になってしょっちゅうそういうことがあると\r\n忘れがちになる感覚だけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110170,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "いやいや、うちはまだまだ全然慣れてないし！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110180,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "街中で声かけられたりすると\r\n『うおっ』ってなるわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110190,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "そろそろ『ヘンソー』とかした方がいい系かな〜\r\nサングラスかけちゃったりとか？",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに必要かもな\r\n最近そういう機会、増えてきてるし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110200,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "有名になるのって嬉しいけど\r\nちょい、自由じゃなくなんだね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110210,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "このままちょー有名になっちゃったら\r\n簡単に出歩けなくなる系？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁ、多少不自由はあるだろうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110220,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "え！\r\nじゃあ、今のうちにちょー遊んどかなきゃじゃん！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110230,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "ヤッバ、そう思ったらじっとしてらんないわ！\r\nプロデューサー、今からどっか行こう～？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん、確かに予定はもうないけど\r\n仕事以外は愛依のプライベートだしなぁ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110240,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "えぇ〜、ダメ～？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110240"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110250,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……そだ！　それなら取材ってことにしちゃえばよくない？\r\nうち、あったまいー",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……いや、やっぱりだめ──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110260,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "──だいじょぶだいじょぶ！\r\n社長に怒られたらうちが謝るからさ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201900511/2019005110260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019005110270,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "ほら！　早く行こう！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
